orbitra-ratvar-scripture-kindle = Kindle
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-kindle-desc = Prepare the tablet, then select a visible target within 7 tiles in 15 seconds. Paralyzes for 15 seconds and mutes for 12. Mindshields prevent paralysis; chaplains and cultists are immune.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-manacles = Hateful Manacles
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-manacles-desc = Select a nearby humanoid within 2 seconds of preparation. Restraining takes another 3 seconds and is interrupted by movement or damage. The manacles crumble when removed; conversion does not require them.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-compromise = Sentinel's Compromise
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-compromise-desc = Within 8 seconds select another living member of your cult within 7 tiles. Heals 60% of physical, heat, cellular and suffocation damage. Half the actual healing becomes poison damage to you, capped at 80.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-vanguard = Vanguard
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-vanguard-desc = For 30 seconds prevents stuns, knockdown, stamina damage and wound slowdown. Other scriptures are blocked during protection. Does not interfere with submission sigils or reduce ordinary damage.
orbitra-ratvar-unavailable-vanguard = Other scriptures are unavailable during Vanguard.
orbitra-ratvar-spell-ready = Prepared: { $spell }. Click a target with the tablet. Reopening the tablet cancels preparation.
orbitra-ratvar-spell-invalid = Invalid target: check range, obstacles, allegiance, target condition and cult energy.
orbitra-ratvar-spell-applied = Applied: { $spell }.
orbitra-ratvar-vanguard-start = Brass light protects you. Other scriptures are temporarily unavailable.
orbitra-ratvar-vanguard-end = Vanguard's protection has faded.
ent-OrbitraRatvarManacles = replicant manacles
    .desc = Heavy brass restraints covered with tiny moving gears.
ent-OrbitraRatvarVanguardStatus = vanguard
ent-OrbitraRatvarManacleRemains = brass dust
